  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "There are NNN gladiators standing in a field. They will fight till only 111 gladiator is left, and the other N−1N - 1N−1 gladiators have been defeated.\n\nInitially, everyone has a skill factor of 000. But, every fight that a gladiator wins, his skill factor increases by 111.\n\nThere will be exactly N−1N - 1N−1 rounds. Each round, 222 gladiators (not yet defeated), will come and fight; and one of will win, the other will be defeated. The entertainment level of a fight between gladiators of skill level XXX and YYY is X+YX + YX+Y. Note that it is possible for the lower skill gladiator to win.\n\nWhat is the minimum and maximum possible total sum of entertainment level over all fights?\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nThe first and only line of input contains a single integer NNN.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output 222 integers - the minimum and maximum possible sums of entertainment levels.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤991 \\le T \\le 991≤T≤99",
      "2≤N≤1002 \\le N \\le 1002≤N≤100"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n2\n3\n4\n5",
        "output": "0 0\n1 1\n2 3\n3 6",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : Only 111 fight happens, between gladiators of skills 000 and 000. Thus, the answer is always 000.\nTest Case 2 : Only 222 fights happen, the first between gladiators of skills 000 and 000, and the second between 000 and 111. Thus, the answer is always 111.\nTest Case 3 : here is how the minimum case is achieved:\n\nGladiator 111 fights gladiator 222 and wins. Entertainment level of 000, gladiator 111 has skill of 111.\nGladiator 333 fights gladiator 444 and wins. Entertainment level of 000, gladiator 333 has skill of 111.\nGladiator 111 fights gladiator 333 and wins. Entertainment level of 222, gladiator 111 has skill of 222.\n\nThus, the final sum of entertainment levels is 222."
      }
    ]
  },
